      <div class="summary">
        <h2>In short</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Business Executive is a business tool. You may use it for your own company while your licence is active.</li>
          <li>Your financial data stays yours. We use it only to run your dashboards.</li>
          <li>The dashboards summarise figures from your accounting system. Check anything important against that system, and against your accountant, before relying on it.</li>
          <li>South African law applies. Questions go to <a href="mailto:info@smart-builders.co.za">info@smart-builders.co.za</a>.</li>
        </ul>
