      <section id="your-data">
        <h2><span class="num">6.</span>Your data</h2>
        <p>You keep ownership of all data you connect or upload. You allow us to collect, store and process it only as needed to provide the service to you, as described in our <a href="/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a>. We do not sell your data or use it for any other purpose.</p>
        <p>You are responsible for having the right to share the data you connect, including any personal information it contains about other people.</p>
      </section>

      <section id="connected">
        <h2><span class="num">7.</span>Connected services</h2>
        <p>The service can connect to QuickBooks Online (Intuit), Xero and Sage Business Cloud. Those services are provided by their own companies under their own terms, which govern your use of them.</p>
        <p>By connecting one, you authorise us to retrieve your profit-and-loss reports from it on your behalf. You can withdraw that authority at any time in its settings. We are not responsible for the availability or accuracy of those services, or for changes they make that affect what we can retrieve.</p>
      </section>

      <section id="accuracy">
        <h2><span class="num">8.</span>Reports are not advice</h2>
        <p>The dashboards summarise figures taken from your accounting system or from files you upload. Their accuracy depends on that source data. Figures may be out of date until you refresh them, and differences in how each system reports can affect totals.</p>
        <p>The service is a reporting tool. It does not provide accounting, tax, investment or legal advice. Confirm important figures in your accounting system, and consult a qualified professional before making decisions based on them.</p>
      </section>

      <section id="availability">
        <h2><span class="num">9.</span>Availability and changes</h2>
        <p>We aim to keep the service available, but we do not guarantee that it will be uninterrupted or free of errors. We may need to suspend it for maintenance or security reasons. We may also improve or change features. If a change significantly reduces what your licence gives you, we will tell you in advance.</p>
